{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Bounty Brawl, a top-down action roguelite shooter supporting 1-4 player online co-op\u2014a place where only the elite and the treacherous survive.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the shadows of the planet Klook Foon lies the infamous secret guild Hunter Haven. It gathers the most dangerous and greedy bounty hunters in the galaxy, all with one goal: to pursue the top bounties on the bulletin board in exchange for unparalleled wealth and glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the Guild Master has fallen into darkness and manipulates everything. Redd, a former hunter, is searching for a powerful individual capable of changing world order. Will you be the chosen one?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097510/extras/19dd86302d6b512dbd42ba62a80ef4e8.poster.avif?t=1761732108\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097510/extras/19dd86302d6b512dbd42ba62a80ef4e8.webm?t=1761732108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097510/extras/19dd86302d6b512dbd42ba62a80ef4e8.mp4?t=1761732108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Meet Your Hunters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select your avatar from a diverse roster of bounty hunters, each with unique abilities and distinct personalities. Whether you prefer an assassin skilled in swift close-quarters combat, a gunslinger with long-range sniping, or a madman devoted to the art of explosion, there's a hunter to match your style. Delve into their backgrounds, master their signature weapons and skills, and stand out in the hunt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097510/extras/ae83218d534ece5f898ba1be84deb553.poster.avif?t=1761732108\" width=614 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097510/extras/ae83218d534ece5f898ba1be84deb553.webm?t=1761732108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097510/extras/ae83218d534ece5f898ba1be84deb553.mp4?t=1761732108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Choose Your Targets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a team with up to 3 other players in the tavern of Hunter Haven. Select your target from the board; each warrant will lead you to a brand-new, perilous alien planet. Prepare yourself, devise strategies, but always be ready to &quot;adapt&quot;\u2014because your partners might be scheming against you too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097510/extras/6332a8b982f12d5111e6adc7c3181619.poster.avif?t=1761732108\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097510/extras/6332a8b982f12d5111e6adc7c3181619.webm?t=1761732108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097510/extras/6332a8b982f12d5111e6adc7c3181619.mp4?t=1761732108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Challenging Missions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level features progressive, room-by-room exploration. Every area is randomized, containing different environmental obstacles, enemy types, and mission objectives. Only by completing the current objective can you proceed to the next area. Make good use of your ultimate tool, the &quot;Lasso&quot; \u2014 it is key to your survival, mobility, collection, execution, and even &quot;betrayal&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097510/extras/f05d17c10ecd2a5e644b13a721ee38f4.poster.avif?t=1761732108\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097510/extras/f05d17c10ecd2a5e644b13a721ee38f4.webm?t=1761732108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097510/extras/f05d17c10ecd2a5e644b13a721ee38f4.mp4?t=1761732108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Encounter Legendary Criminals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mission culminates in a critical moment where hunters temporarily set aside suspicion to face a legendary Boss together. Each legendary criminal possesses unique mechanics and devastating attack patterns, requiring your full cooperation to challenge them. And after defeating the boss, there's a fun &quot;surprise twist&quot; segment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097510/extras/a3bcf70e5970452059aec0807862243c.poster.avif?t=1761732108\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097510/extras/a3bcf70e5970452059aec0807862243c.webm?t=1761732108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097510/extras/a3bcf70e5970452059aec0807862243c.mp4?t=1761732108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to join the crazy party of cooperation, competition, and backstabbing in <i>Bounty Brawl: Most Wanted</i>?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3097510?t=1761732108","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097510/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761732108","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097510/2ef0feca893ed4c407c1a22f86b84f20d6f6d65f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761732108","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097510/2ef0feca893ed4c407c1a22f86b84f20d6f6d65f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761732108","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Bounty Brawl, a top-down action roguelite shooter supporting 1-4 player online co-op\u2014a place where only the elite and the treacherous survive.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the shadows of the planet Klook Foon lies the infamous secret guild Hunter Haven. It gathers the most dangerous and greedy bounty hunters in the galaxy, all with one goal: to pursue the top bounties on the bulletin board in exchange for unparalleled wealth and glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the Guild Master has fallen into darkness and manipulates everything. Redd, a former hunter, is searching for a powerful individual capable of changing world order. Will you be the chosen one?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: ce