:"Welcome to Hunter Haven! Bounty Brawl is a top-down action roguelite shooter for 1-4 players. Here, the hunt is fierce, and betrayal is inevitable. Will you form a fragile alliance with other hunters under the galaxy's most notorious bounties, or go it alone? Who will emerge as the ultimate victor?","steam_appid":3097510,"support_info":{"email":"info@nanuq.co.th","url":"http://www.nanuq.co.th/"},"supported_languages":"English, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Thai, Traditional Chinese","type":"game","website":"https://www.nanuq.co.th/bounty-brawl-most-wanted"}